{title: Unto the Hills}
{artist: John Campbell, Duke of Argyll}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 72}

Verse 1
Un[G]to the hills a[C]round do I lift [G]up my longing [D]eyes:
O [G]whence for me shall [C]my sal[G]vation [D]come, from whence a[G]rise?
From [D]God the Lord doth [Em]come my [C]certain [G]aid —
from [G]God the Lord, who [C]heaven and [G]earth hath [D]made.
